# Copy to .env.local and adjust. Commit .env.example, never .env.local.

# Base URL of the meme-api backend, with NO trailing slash.
# Leave this UNSET during local development: Vite proxies /api to
# http://localhost:8787 (see vite.config.ts) so both sides stay same-origin
# and the browser never sees a cross-origin request.
#
# Set it when the API is deployed somewhere else:
# VITE_API_URL=https://meme-api.vercel.app
#
# Reminder: VITE_* values are inlined at BUILD time. Changing this requires a
# rebuild/redeploy, not just a restart.